    "title": "Man dies after truck crashes into canal in Sunrise, officials say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Briana Trujillo ,\n10 hours ago A man has died after his truck crashed into a canal in Sunrise on Thursday, officials said. The incident happened when the truck crashed through a wall on the west side of Broward Health's freestanding emergency room near West Oakland Park Boulevard and Northwest 94th Avenue, Sunrise Fire Rescue officials said. Read full article\n2",
